<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">14062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran says the text of a deal to end its war with the United States is agreed, and Pakistan expects an electronic signing within hours.</s> <s>The accord would reopen the Strait of Hormuz, the channel for a fifth of the world's oil, even as Iranian drones struck commercial ships over the weekend.</s> <s>Tehran insists its enriched uranium stays underground, and whether Trump's victory framing survives contact with Iran's red lines remains to be seen.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan-administered Kashmir has gone without internet for an eighth straight day, as authorities raid homes and seize businesses tied to the banned Joint Awami Action Committee.</s> <s>A week-long blackout that cuts off students and freelancers is collective punishment of a kind that rarely reaches a global feed.</s> <s>Young people are now crossing into Khyber Pakhtunkhwa just to get online, and no one has named a date for restoration.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hungary's Viktor Orban was re-elected leader of Fidesz by seven hundred twenty-nine of seven hundred thirty-seven delegates, running unopposed.</s> <s>His party collapsed from thirty-nine percent to seventeen in April, losing the country to a pro-Western supermajority, yet the machine remains his alone.</s> <s>He's lost the nation but kept the party, positioning himself to obstruct Hungary's pivot back toward Europe from the opposition benches.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An investigation has reconstructed how Venezuelan security forces tortured and killed their own detainees during a twenty twenty-four anti-gang sweep.</s> <s>Operation Zaraza pushed six thousand troops into Guárico state, where residents documented detentions and extrajudicial killings alongside the raids on armed groups.</s> <s>Caracas denies wrongdoing, and the episode shows how militarized crackdowns can blur the line between the state and the gangs it claims to fight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel is seeking a military base in Somaliland at Bab al-Mandab, the southern gateway to the Red Sea.</s> <s>December's recognition deal bought it an intelligence foothold near a chokepoint that Yemen already bars Israeli ships from crossing.</s> <s>Somalia has rejected the overture outright, and the contest for the Horn's coastline is far from settled.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australia is fast-tracking cuts that could strip two hundred thousand people from its national disability scheme by twenty thirty-one.</s> <s>Health Minister Mark Butler is pushing the bill through parliament this month, warning the opposition that delay could cost billions.</s> <s>State ministers say they can't replace the support being withdrawn, leaving disabled Australians to absorb austerity dressed as fiscal urgency.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia says it's solved the payment impasse with China that Western sanctions created, clearing bilateral trade without any dollar middleman.</s> <s>State bank platforms now settle the two economies' commerce directly, and an envoy says they're moving from tactical fixes toward deep financial integration.</s> <s>The claim comes from Russian state media, but the drift toward trade settled outside the dollar is real, and it reshapes who controls the plumbing of global commerce.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Zimbabwe-linked group has bought the debts of Tongaat Hulett, once one of southern Africa's biggest sugar producers, at a steep discount.</s> <s>It then used that cheap debt to pressure South Africa's state lender into funding a rescue that would hand it control across four countries.</s> <s>A Durban court resumes the liquidation hearing on the seventeenth... while poor South Africans direct their anger at Zimbabwean migrants instead of the insiders capturing the asset.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Narendra Modi heads to the Evian summit as a guest of the G7, not a member, carrying the demands of the Global South.</s> <s>France wants India inside a coalition to secure the Strait of Hormuz, but Modi will press debt relief and climate finance first.</s> <s>Whether a guest can bend a rich-country club toward the poorer majority is the quiet test of the meeting this week, God willing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in New Zealand are extracting edible protein from ordinary leaves, food for the day staple crops fail.</s> <s>David Denkenberger's team at Canterbury has spent a decade preparing for the scenario where nuclear winter or climate shock collapses global farming.</s> <s>The work is early, but it asks a question most of us avoid... what the world eats when the fields go dark.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Four hundred seventy-six fossil whales have been found carpeting an abyss in the Indian Ocean, six thousand seven hundred metres down.</s> <s>The seafloor's V-shaped topography funnels carcasses into a single zone, where scientists counted nearly three thousand organisms per square metre, most possibly new to science.</s> <s>This discovery extends the known range of whale-fall ecosystems by two and a half kilometres, opening a hidden world beneath the waves.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Scientists have mapped how the hepatitis B virus drives liver cancer, not by mutating genes but by silencing the body's own tumor-suppressors.</s> <s>The virus rewrites gene regulation through methylation, a switch that targeted drugs might one day flip back, and its cancer burden falls heaviest on Asia and Africa.</s> <s>Early inhibitors show promise, though none has yet reached patients.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Physicists have generated three hundred fifty frequency-comb lines inside a chip-scale magnon resonator, a record for spin-wave hardware.</s> <s>Frequency combs underpin atomic clocks and spectroscopy, and building one without optical parts opens the door to microwave processors on a single chip.</s> <s>Uses in neuromorphic computing and precision sensing are still years away.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A new model can predict, from genetic sequence alone, which targets a T-cell receptor will attack.</s> <s>That specificity governs how the immune system chooses its enemies, and reading it could unlock programmable vaccines and tailored cancer therapies.</s> <s>The method still has to prove itself on clinical data before it guides any treatment.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
